  "problem": "Which of the following random variables can be modeled as a discrete uniform distribution?\n\nI. The number obtained when spinning a roulette wheel that is biased towards landing on $0.$\n\nII. The number obtained when picking a rational number between $0$ and $1$ at random.\n\nIII. The IQ of a randomly selected student.",
